        "id": 126846,
        "name": "Estelindis",
        "username": "Estelindis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/estelindis/{size}/2017_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-03T13:04:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes, some more communication would be good. &nbsp;When it comes to the EU shipping discrepancies for the Villains pre-order that I posted about, even an acknowledgement saying that they're looking into it would be nice. &nbsp;I guess I thought that GtG might feel tired of the huge amount of repetition involved in trying to get the same bureaucrats to do the same thing over and over re. the French VAT number, but that this new issue might be more easily solvable, and thus not such a drag for them. &nbsp;On the other hand, maybe they actually can't be sure the new shipping will work out at all until the current matter with the Wrath of the Cosmos pre-orders is sorted out... &nbsp;All speculation on my part. &nbsp;Again, a bit of communication would help, with speculation being replaced by solid facts.</p><p>Still, at least one nice thing came out of this: Mezike offering a set of Dark Watch promos to TheSoundOfTrees. &nbsp;Very kind! &nbsp;:)</p>",
        "post_number": 71,
        "post_type": 1,
