        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-03T13:20:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Mezike\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c6cbf5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Mezike:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>TheSoundOfTrees wrote:</b><br><blockquote>I already had to pass Dark Watch, thematically my favorite team\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;Send me a pm... I still have one set left over from the bulk order I did at the time that went unclaimed and it is now yours.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is very kind of you.</p>",
