        "id": 126848,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-03T15:26:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We are very close to a solution, but don't want to post something in a super-public-announcement kind of way until we are 100% certain.</p><p>However, I will say here that 1) I completely understand your frustration and 2) Jodie is right now over at another facility attempting to print labels which, if successful, should allow us to circumvent the \"lack of VAT number\" problem and ship all of the EU preorders before the end of the week.</p>",
