        "created_at": "2015-02-04T00:19:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just saw Paul's post about this in the announcement forum. &nbsp;Great news. &nbsp;It's nice that another local company was able to help out, with the assistance of Fed Ex. &nbsp;Of course, GtG has helped other businesses when they had shipping problems, so it's a good example of \"what goes around comes around.\"</p><p>Looking forward to receiving my copy of Wrath soon. &nbsp;:)</p>",
